{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"docKey","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The key of the document whose header is being recorded.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"bytes","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The serialized header.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It leaves the snapshot alone – an online client syncs constantly, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-snapshotting per sync would reintroduce the cost this interface exists to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"avoid – and it leaves the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"log"}]},{"type":"text","text":" alone too."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That second part is load-bearing. The log does two jobs: it holds un-pushed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes so they survive a reload, and it is the delta between the snapshot and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the document’s current content. Deleting acknowledged entries serves the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"job and destroys the second, because nothing brings the snapshot forward on a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"push-ack – the content would then exist in neither place while the persisted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"serverSeq","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" claims the server has it. Only compaction trims the log, and it does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so by folding the entries into a new snapshot first.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The header itself carries the acknowledged "},{"code":"clientSeq","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so a restore reads it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from there; the store needs no separate parameter for it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It is a no-op when nothing is stored for the key.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the underlying storage raises."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"externalID":"s:6Yorkie14MemoryDocStoreC8saveMeta6docKey5bytesySS_10Foundation4DataVtYaKF","title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"]}],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"title":"Yorkie","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)","title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore":{"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that keeps documents in memory for the lifetime of the process.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MemoryDocStore"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MemoryDocStore"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MemoryDocStore","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore","title":"DocStore"}}}